age URL. For 100+ cards or a repair/migration, stop and apply `zenray-git-bulk-safety`.\n\nNever commit source code changes or store external poster URLs directly. Report title, category, status, score, and the immutable poster URL.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: 1. Doi Takeo, 『甘えの構造』, Le jeu de l'indulgence (1971) — \n\n2. Kishimi Ichirō & Koga Fumitake, 『嫌われる勇気』, Avoir le courage de ne pas être aimé (2013)\n\n1. Marisa Franco, Platonic (2022) — l'axe mécanique\n\n3. Erich Fromm, L'art d'aimer (1956) — l'axe capacité\n\najoute ces 4 livres sur le site dans la section livres"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"abf52e62-61b4-4304-9d39-c99592f52b2b","timestamp":"2026-08-26T06:58:24.330Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/Create/Build/Memory","sessionId":"846814fa-bdd6-4759-8e85-8140d1c6e221","version":"2.1.246","gitBranch":"main"}
